ical Proposals form the management/quality evaluation.","family":"references_past_performance","gap_id":"human-evidence:FSSA-010-experience","kind":"SCORED","lineage_id":"FSSA-010-experience","reason":"BLOCKING_REQUIREMENT_NEEDS_OWNER_EVIDENCE","section_id":"AttE.9.0-10.0","severity":"SCORED","source_id":"fssa-official-package-20261003","source_ref":"https://secure.in.gov/idoa/proc/solicitations/files/004980000088284.zip","source_sha256":"0bc2c4a47aa2cba6b5732b9308c6d581befd9df957dc03c22796349b5279b867"},{"blocking":true,"detail":"Provide three Attachment H references from clients for whom the respondent provided the same or similar services. Clients complete and send their forms directly to the State; receipt is due October 28, 2026 at 3:00 PM Eastern Time.","family":"references_past_performance","gap_id":"human-evidence:FSSA-011-three-client-references","kind":"MANDATORY","lineage_id":"FSSA-011-three-client-references","reason":"BLOCKING_REQUIREMENT_NEEDS_OWNER_EVIDENCE","section_id":"AttE.6.0-and-AttH","severity":"HOLD","source_id":"fssa-official-package-20261003","source_ref":"https://secure.in.gov/idoa/proc/solicitations/files/004980000088284.zip","source_sha256":"0bc2c4a47aa2cba6b5732b9308c6d581befd9df957dc03c22796349b5279b867"},{"blocking":true,"detail":"If subcontractors are proposed, disclose every subcontractor, workshare, qualifications, contractual relationship and anticipated amount. Include an executed subcontract or signed letter of agreement; combined qualifications may be evaluated, while the respondent remains responsible.","family":"subcontractor_partner_matrix","gap_id":"human-evidence:FSSA-012-subcontractor-commitments","kind":"MANDATORY","lineage_id":"FSSA-012-subcontractor-commitments","reason":"BLOCKING_REQUIREMENT_NEEDS_OWNER_EVIDENCE","section_id":"AttE.13.0","severity":"HOLD","source_id":"fssa-official-package-20261003","source_ref":"https://secure.in.gov/idoa/proc/solicitations/files/004980000088284.zip","source_sha256":"0bc2c4a47aa2cba6b