ORY","lineage_id":"FSSA-019-conflicts-and-certifications","reason":"BLOCKING_REQUIREMENT_NEEDS_OWNER_EVIDENCE","section_id":"RFP.1.18-1.19.p12","severity":"HOLD","source_id":"fssa-official-package-20261003","source_ref":"https://secure.in.gov/idoa/proc/solicitations/files/004980000088284.zip","source_sha256":"0bc2c4a47aa2cba6b5732b9308c6d581befd9df957dc03c22796349b5279b867"},{"blocking":true,"detail":"For proposed IT products or services, establish compatibility with applicable State IT policies and the assistive-technology standard, and address the RFP's ADA compliance requirement. Sensitive standards may require a contractor NDA.","family":"accessibility","gap_id":"human-evidence:FSSA-020-it-and-accessibility","kind":"MANDATORY","lineage_id":"FSSA-020-it-and-accessibility","reason":"BLOCKING_REQUIREMENT_NEEDS_OWNER_EVIDENCE","section_id":"RFP.1.3-and-1.22.p6-13","severity":"HOLD","source_id":"fssa-official-package-20261003","source_ref":"https://secure.in.gov/idoa/proc/solicitations/files/004980000088284.zip","source_sha256":"0bc2c4a47aa2cba6b5732b9308c6d581befd9df957dc03c22796349b5279b867"},{"blocking":true,"detail":"Propose MAC framework modernization, redesigned and piloted time-study tools with FSSA and AAAs, standardized cost-reporting and cost-pooling processes, and support for AAA monitoring and quality improvement.","family":"implementation_delivery","gap_id":"human-evidence:FSSA-022-mac-modernization","kind":"MANDATORY","lineage_id":"FSSA-022-mac-modernization","reason":"BLOCKING_REQUIREMENT_NEEDS_OWNER_EVIDENCE","section_id":"AttF.1.2-1.5-and-AttK.Scope","severity":"HOLD","source_id":"fssa-official-package-20261003","source_ref":"https://secure.in.gov/idoa/proc/solicitations/files/004980000088284.zip","source_sha256":"0bc2c4a47aa2cba6b5732b9308c6d581befd9df957dc03c22796349b5279b867"},{"blocking":true,"detail":"Provide a plan for MAC claiming operations and error-free claim files during the base term and any extensions, stakeholder support, additional-age